  triage:title "Sprint doc's literal required-validation command `cargo test -p atm-herdr` fails to compile (E0432 unresolved import atm_herdr::testing)" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr (qa-pr1269-r2, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1269#issuecomment-5562897370, ARCH-002) reproduced at e12c87da2 that bare `cargo test -p atm-herdr` (the exact command in docs/plans/phase-ay/sprint-AY.2-herdr-transport-seam.md required validation) fails with E0432 unresolved import atm_herdr::testing because crates/atm-herdr/Cargo.toml has no [dev-dependencies] self-entry activating test-utils; `--all-features` masks it." ;
